# Managed by the cairn skill.
# No committed generated/index files (see references/artifacts.md), so nothing in
# docs/ needs a custom merge driver — with one exception.
#
# The pending changelog accumulates one bullet per task/bug `finish`. Sibling
# members of the same batch/milestone are dispatched in parallel and each appends
# to it independently, so a plain three-way merge conflicts on every sibling after
# the first — on exactly the fan-out references/orchestration.md prescribes.
# `union` keeps both sides' bullets instead: order within the file carries no
# meaning, and the container's own `finish` finalizes the accumulated list into a
# versioned file anyway.
docs/changelog/UNRELEASED.md merge=union
